              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Karen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Love this simple pie. It's easy to make and definitely a crowd pleaser for those that enjoy lemon. The bottom layer is more tangy as it's the concentrated lemon pudding (with lemon juice added), while the middle is more smooth, creamy, light, and sweet. I receive requests from friends and family for this pie. My only tweak is I usually make it with a shortbread crust. Yum!",
